WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.370
Lab 2 moves to a test
domain, never production,

2
00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:08.125
with a Windows Server 2025 domain
controller and member server.

3
00:00:08.125 --> 00:00:10.864
You make two test accounts,
one for each path,

4
00:00:10.864 --> 00:00:14.668
record their decisions by running
Chapters 2 and 3 over them,

5
00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:19.157
and grant the reader only a narrow
delegated read of the root key's dates,

6
00:00:19.157 --> 00:00:23.113
recording whether that really
works without exposing the key.

7
00:00:23.113 --> 00:00:26.551
A second person reviews the
plan and hands you its hash.

8
00:00:26.551 --> 00:00:30.975
You apply it as a person, then run
the next plan to start the migration,

9
00:00:30.975 --> 00:00:34.925
restart only the test service,
and watch the Kerberos events.

10
00:00:34.925 --> 00:00:38.570
After thirty days, complete
it, or back it out by hand.
